                                    >
                                        Creating <br />Role Models
                                    </h1>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Right Content -->
                        <div class="home_hero-header_content-right">
                            <div>
                                <p class="text-size-medium text-color-white">
                                    <strong>
                                        ICON School of Excellence comprises of a
                                        dedicated team that is passionately
                                        committed to enhancing the quality of
                                        education in Bangalore. This founding
                                        group is composed of professionals from
                                        a rich tapestry of fields, including
                                        medicine, management, academia, and
                                        psychology. Each member brings unique
                                        insights and experiences, fostering a
                                        collaborative spirit that enriches the
                                        learning environment.
                                    </strong>
                                </p>
                                <br />
                                <div class="rich-text-block w-richtext">
                                    <p>
                                        <strong>
                                            ‍ Together, we create an inspiring
                                            atmosphere where creativity and
                                            critical thinking flourish. This
                                            diverse team understands the
                                            complexities of education and the
                                            importance of holistic development,
                                            ensuring that every child is
                                            nurtured academically, socially, and
                                            emotionally.
                                        </strong>
                                    </p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="margin-top margin-medium">
                                <div class="button-group">
                                    <a
                                        href="/admissions"
                                        class="button w-button">Admissions</a
                                    >
                                    <a
                                        href="/about"
                                        class="button is-secondary w-button"
                                        >About ICON</a
                                    >
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Background Image Slider -->
    <div class="home_hero-header_background-image-wrapper">
        <div class="image-overlay-layer"></div>
        <div class="carousel-wrapper">
            <div class="carousel-track" id="carouselTrack">
                <img
                    src="https://ik.imagekit.io/brandswift/isoe/assets/images/home/slider.webp?updatedAt=1745912101789"
